flowchart LR
    Legacy["Existing mixed Git history"] --> Rewrite["Rewrite blobs, authors, refs and tags"]
    Releases["Existing releases and artifacts"] --> Purge["Delete and replace assets"]
    Rewrite --> Gate["Publication gate"]
    Purge --> Gate
    Gate --> Host["Rewritten public repository"]
    Copies["Clones, caches and downloads"] -. "cannot be recalled" .-> Host
